17.720">Make </span><span begin="00:17.720" end="00:18.080">it </span><span begin="00:18.080" end="00:19.610">okay</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.570" end="00:23.630"><span begin="00:20.570" end="00:20.990">See </span><span begin="00:20.990" end="00:21.080">a </span><span begin="00:21.080" end="00:21.440">war </span><span begin="00:21.440" end="00:21.530">I </span><span begin="00:21.530" end="00:21.740">want </span><span begin="00:21.740" end="00:21.860">to </span><span begin="00:21.860" end="00:22.400">fight </span><span begin="00:22.400" end="00:23.630">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.660" end="00:26.480"><span begin="00:23.660" end="00:24.110">See </span><span begin="00:24.110" end="00:24.200">a </span><span begin="00:24.200" end="00:24.530">match </span><span begin="00:24.530" end="00:24.620">I </span><span begin="00:24.620" end="00:24.830">want </span><span begin="00:24.830" end="00:24.920">to </span><span begin="00:24.920" end="00:25.520">strike </span><span begin="00:25.520" end="00:26.480">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.900" end="00:29.540"><span begin="00:26.900" end="00:27.260">Every </span><span begin="00:27.260" end="00:27.830">fire </span><span begin="00:27.830" end="00:28.010">I've </span><span begin="00:28.010" end="00:29.540">ignited</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.570" end="00:32.090"><span begin="00:29.570" end="00:30.380">Faded </span><span begin="00:30.380" end="00:30.830">to </span><span begin="00:30.830" end="00:32.090">gray</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.540" end="00:35.810"><span begin="00:32.540" end="00:32.750">But </span><span begin="00:32.750" end="00:33.020">now </span><span begin="00:33.020" end="00:33.290">that </span><span begin="00:33.290" end="00:33.530">I'm </span><span begin="00:33.530" end="00:35.810">broken</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.840" end="00:38.750"><span begin="00:35.840" end="00:36.110">Now </span><span begin="00:36.110" end="00:36.320">that </span><span 