" end="01:00.740">with </span><span begin="01:00.740" end="01:00.830">a </span><span begin="01:00.830" end="01:02.000">poison </span><span begin="01:02.000" end="01:03.380">pen</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.530" end="01:06.410"><span begin="01:03.530" end="01:03.800">But </span><span begin="01:03.800" end="01:03.980">these </span><span begin="01:03.980" end="01:04.790">chemicals </span><span begin="01:04.790" end="01:05.180">moving </span><span begin="01:05.180" end="01:05.870">between </span><span begin="01:05.870" end="01:06.410">us</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.560" end="01:14.150"><span begin="01:06.560" end="01:06.740">Are </span><span begin="01:06.740" end="01:06.920">the </span><span begin="01:06.920" end="01:08.180">reason </span><span begin="01:08.180" end="01:08.510">to </span><span begin="01:08.510" end="01:09.350">start </span><span begin="01:09.350" end="01:14.150">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.730" end="01:19.400"><span begin="01:16.730" end="01:17.090">Now </span><span begin="01:17.090" end="01:17.210">I'm </span><span begin="01:17.210" end="01:17.690">holding </span><span begin="01:17.690" end="01:17.840">on </span><span begin="01:17.840" end="01:18.020">for </span><span begin="01:18.020" end="01:18.380">dear </span><span begin="01:18.380" end="01:19.400">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.850" end="01:22.010"><span begin="01:19.850" end="01:20.120">There's </span><span begin="01:20.120" end="01:20.300">no </span><span begin="01:20.300" end="01:20.540">way </span><span begin="01:20.540" end="01:20.720">that </span><span begin="01:20.720" end="01:20.900">we </span><span begin="01:20.900" end="01:21.140">can </span><span begin="01:21.140" end="01:22.010">rewind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.820" end="01:25.370"><span begin="01:22.820" end="01:23.270">Maybe </span><span begin="01:23.270" end="01:23.450">there's </span><span begin="01:23.450" end="01:23.900">nothing </span><span begin="01:23.90